Internal fixed SQL table/column allowlist admits configuration envelopes64KiB, reference content256KiB, application bindings/source paths64KiB, max100 unique cells/1MiB aggregate. Values use bound PK parameters. `octet_length(convert_to(jsonb::text,'UTF8'))` and type/identity checks occur BEFORE JSON transfer. The metric is canonical stored JSONB text bytes, NOT Python serialization length/RSS/TOAST/scan cost. Unique-cell dedup is same-entry only and still checks immutable identity/type/size; repeated cells share internally retained admitted values.

Exact D11 scalar discovery uses StageA winner and revoked short circuit; local reader gates precede discovery. Envelope admission is followed by structural artifact extraction ONLY. Valid D11 has one artifact descriptor, not generic string/list fallback. Reference content is admitted before any future native validation; this module deliberately calls none of validate_envelope/application_health/source_health/owner_current. Optional inherited application/source configuration/reference/binding cells are admitted with observer source case.read/policy.read BEFORE source payload. Source-family head uses the native ANY historical active/revoked state predicate only when current source state is active; native missing-head AttributeError is preserved. Unexpected recursively applied source structure fails closed.

This returns readiness/IDs, NOT native policy validity/current ownership/authorization. Original owner/applicator/activation principal gates, native schema/hash/binding equality and targeted Finance/leadership privacy gates are still required by a future reviewed caller after complete admission. Bounded-admission failure must abort investigation, never be saved as owner_current=false. No retraction currentness or template selection.

